      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. can u make it a bit more specific tho? maybe talk about how the people in charge seem to care way more about globalist policies or certain social issues than they do about the actual cost of living or the jobs that used to keep our towns alive. like, just really hammer home the idea that they're basically working against the interests of regular people.",
